[{"client_msg_id":"80109753-8a29-4687-9feb-643ae2d11ee5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、よくもわるくもcli的に「実行して終了」だと、他言語でのwarmupでの場合も含みますが、あんまり変な影響は見えないですしね","ts":"1636555192.423900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tnZ8m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f14ef683-3913-471c-accb-74d956c522d8","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ふわふわ","ts":"1636554859.422900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9vFA3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01214d43-8f99-40c6-8757-32771b7c2e47","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"っと思わせてかなり多くのケースで湯水のごとく使って大丈夫なのが凄いんすよね\nなんか「多くのケース」ってふわっとしてるけど・・・","ts":"1636554467.422400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3or+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44cc03bf-1133-429e-bd51-9095dcf494b5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そこはスレッドプールもそうだし、わかるけど、事前にランタイムかpreforkというかwarmupしていると考えると、あんまり安易な「簡単、軽い、便利」と思ってしまうのもまずいときもあるのかもなあ","ts":"1636553757.421600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"APA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aea145dc-0ba8-4517-8938-bd676dbf799e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"スレッドの中で、動く対象がころころ変わるという。","ts":"1636553698.420500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V9FB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab5f4b20-5037-48ab-96c3-7187a3c92472","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ちょっと他の言語のスレッドと比較して話しづらいけど。","ts":"1636553682.420100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/oUq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2374e5c4-bfce-4f7e-8f31-7a54a89a9b8a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"goroutine は状況によってコルーチンになったりスレッドになったりするんですが、スレッドの場合はプールがありますね。","ts":"1636553671.419700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BnS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c5d6291-ecee-40f1-acef-e11c40433f08","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあfibre的だから?\nとはいえ、事前にスレッド生成もしてるんかな?","ts":"1636552947.418900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DR1u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31795b1f-4ac7-45ac-9c98-b1be0c56e97d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"fork やスレッドはオーバーヘッドがある程度あるので、パフォーマンス稼ぐには prefork やスレッドプール等が必須になるけど、Go の場合軽いのであんまりアドバンテージが無いと思ってる。","ts":"1636552767.418400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Luz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b26d95f5-f2dd-4d4f-a12d-911257846c6a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1636517901.417100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nfmN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1d9d01e-77d4-4584-b62a-150a28046f77","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"ぶん回したいけど制限はかけておきたいやつ","ts":"1636514570.416800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LIqC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cac4e41-2b32-45dc-a45d-9b3a023a7e2e","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"errorgroupとsemaphoreを合せたやつ作ったことあるな","ts":"1636514506.415500","edited":{"user":"UNJ2DANJC","ts":"1636514523.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ald"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4932eecc-bf22-4aa4-8227-de006a4b9d3d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"interfaceをJavaまでの感覚で使って死ぬ、とかねw","ts":"1636513214.414200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cQZ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"こんな感じで、別の実行モデルの影響でabuseが多くなってて、そのせいで難しく感じてるだけだと僕は思いますよ。","ts":"1636513160.413700","attachments":[{"color":"D0D0D0","fallback":"[November 10th, 2021 11:00 AM] itchyny: (想像だけどpreforkのイメージが強い人がGoに来たときに書きがちだと思っている) (その類推でちゃんとやるなら同等のことが必要になって面倒; UWSGIでいうmax-requestsやmax-worker-lifetimeとか)","author_id":"U7H4TJEG0","author_name":"itchyny","author_subname":"itchyny","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U7H4TJEG0","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b0fac9b99a58f325a05a8afbc18dbc54.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0009-48.png","text":"(想像だけどpreforkのイメージが強い人がGoに来たときに書きがちだと思っている) (その類推でちゃんとやるなら同等のことが必要になって面倒; UWSGIでいうmax-requestsやmax-worker-lifetimeとか)","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #lang-go","ts":1636509646.389600,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CGABGC8LA/p1636509646389600"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WH65r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"266bcf09-d403-49c5-ae5b-3ebc23d2d0e0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"goroutine難しい…","ts":"1636512989.412900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gyR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58a0e948-57af-4891-af8d-6d4a32e1e632","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; 僕の解釈では、chanってのは「取得に時間のかかるリソース、その時間を裏に逃がす仕組み」なんですよ。そこから外れるとだいたいおかしなことになる。\nなるほど、この判断基準はわかりやすいと思いました","ts":"1636512979.412700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Xc6M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f705f59-c30c-4d17-bc41-37739b2349b9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1636512919.412200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ymj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66cf5d74-b441-4216-8be4-216e81acbb0f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"chanだと出てきた値がいつの値だか保証できないんだよな。1秒に1回取る必要があるけどある時刻には取れなかった、みたいな情報がchanだと失われるので、ウォッチには適さないという観点もあるかも。","ts":"1636511714.411500","thread_ts":"1636511177.406600","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636511734.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H2htm"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"c330481b-701e-449b-9e0b-114c3e1173f1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"モノによりますが、たぶんそのケースは良くないですね。\n\nたんなるウォッチなら単に `go func() { for { fetch() } }` で良いわけですよ。","ts":"1636511177.406600","thread_ts":"1636511177.406600","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636511255.000000"},"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"seTA"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"222f8934-a7aa-49b2-bb56-6a60c8dfe2c1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"mainパッケージ内で終了が自分の責任に収まるなら考えなくてよい、(終了に責任を持てない)公開パッケージでは考えるべき、(最悪終了するかを全部チェックできる)internalは考えなくてもよいが基本的には考えたほうが良い、みたいになります。","ts":"1636511540.411300","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636511577.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cXtMH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e94abd6-5010-4a2e-a1b1-1890ab5a1285","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なのでそのウォッチする「なにか」の取得に時間がかかるものならそのchanの利用は問題ないです。\n\nただし終了することを考えなくてよいか、はまた別の話になりますね。","ts":"1636511423.409800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jsd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62ff0d12-1d05-49b3-83f7-be7949ade546","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕の解釈では、chanってのは「取得に時間のかかるリソース、その時間を裏に逃がす仕組み」なんですよ。そこから外れるとだいたいおかしなことになる。","ts":"1636511232.407500","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636511297.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UAR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c330481b-701e-449b-9e0b-114c3e1173f1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"モノによりますが、たぶんそのケースは良くないですね。\n\nたんなるウォッチなら単に `go func() { for { fetch() } }` で良いわけですよ。","ts":"1636511177.406600","thread_ts":"1636511177.406600","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636511255.000000"},"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"seTA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b585d2d-2f75-4e8b-b665-3e4dec5ba639","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"プログラムが終了するまでずっとなにかをウォッチし続ける場合は for range ch を使うのは良いかなと思ったんですが、それも良くないんでしょうか？","ts":"1636510667.405600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hTmV="}]},{"client_msg_id":"7afd1b2b-e2fd-45d0-b6f0-53cf38a700f2","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"でも一回は通る道","ts":"1636510541.404500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HlU="}]},{"client_msg_id":"51435ab0-feae-40f9-9125-c736c236705c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なので「chan\u0026amp;goroutineをiterator代わりにするのは悪」と僕は言い切ります。","ts":"1636510441.403700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636510453.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cmgIN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d34f31c-d6ad-4df7-af08-bc3bf5a2f060","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"chanをcloseすればええやんって思うかもだけど、読みとり用のchanはcloseできないので、もう使わないよというメッセージを書き込み側に伝えるためになにかしらの仕組み(contextなど)が要るようになるんで、期待していたシンプルなiteratorモデルのコストを超えちゃうんですね。","ts":"1636510401.403100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636510419.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WOQs4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb71b298-649d-4efe-837f-7c0f2ea036fc","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"chanのrangeはむずかしい","ts":"1636510350.402200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y0N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"330a0312-39dd-4fb4-92b3-6a8322e230f9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどなぁああ","ts":"1636510345.402000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2dG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01e8f1e2-21f8-4a12-b4b3-714ef1c89031","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あと「終われるんだけど終わらない可能性のあるgoroutine」ってのもあって、それは「iterator代わりに使ってるchan\u0026amp;goroutine」\n\nchanを全部読み切れば終わるんですが、読む側が読み切らないままchanを捨てちゃう場合があるんで。そうなるとchan\u0026amp;goroutineがリークしていくのでbad practiceです。\n\n(gomigemoでやってる :syobon:","ts":"1636510302.401400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zIF3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3d035ea-bb51-47bd-8625-0217085a9acf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどお","ts":"1636510165.399100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f3v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d867eae-44ba-487f-b7e4-a89bc0324854","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"goroutineに限らず、ネットアクセスとかブロックする時間が読めないものにはタイムアウト(context.Context)入れたほうがrobustなシステムにはなるんですが、じゃあそれが必須かというとnoです。\n\n今、論じてるのは「終わらないgoroutineには終われる手段をいれておく」です。","ts":"1636510148.398900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E3Evu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31129f0b-326f-4618-83fd-5d76bef6405a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いえタイムアウトである必要はないです。","ts":"1636510030.396600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KbUwp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3b314ff-6071-4c1f-b785-5530b6f24b3a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そうなると基本タイムアウト？処理はgoroutineを使うときは必須って考えになるんですが、合っていますか？","ts":"1636510017.396300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AE9hU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f32f214-ab38-459c-9e74-7ac3219e5e09","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"たしかに、動きっぱなしでいつ止まるかわからない処理でリソース持っていける可能性は充分ありえますね","ts":"1636509987.395700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FouRw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bce3cf9e-9717-40a7-a803-86a07e3de05f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"止まらないgoroutineは、スレッドというリソースを食い尽くす場合がありますゆえ。というか何度もやったw","ts":"1636509928.395000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Frc1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"751faf14-de32-4a3f-adcf-4286dc23db02","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、なるほど","ts":"1636509898.394400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ii/uS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f0e1bbe-c44a-4b3c-b50c-b284ddfca0bf","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"「いつ止まるかわからない」です。","ts":"1636509892.394100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H6VpP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9ec5d53-aba9-4beb-a6b3-4cd8d6268ad3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ああ違います。","ts":"1636509887.393800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sz+D+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05a7f312-93f7-449d-af00-fb8362c6084f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自明じゃない = 条件が複雑って解釈しました","ts":"1636509873.393500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rGMZJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72fc0d96-5f57-41a9-862a-f84973b1c519","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; もしくは終了条件が自明な場合\n終了条件で自明じゃない場合に困ることって何かあるんでしょうか？","ts":"1636509847.393100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PMr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5377a71-6770-4b53-a33f-1228c939937d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もう少し進んだ人には、「バンバン作って良いのはすぐに終わること、もしくは終了条件が自明な場合」と僕なら説明しますね。","ts":"1636509777.392600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wIrKX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4477cb06-f0f3-48d8-a46e-e28a2bedee37","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"# まぁそれはそれとしてジョブランナーはいるんですがw","ts":"1636509733.391600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"il+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e92b160-c79a-44f5-bbb1-e32a6ac2fff1","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"goroutineはバンバン作ってええんやで","ts":"1636509721.391300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vfY9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e22001ca-9d89-4250-9cf8-05942215152c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ですねぇ。preforkとかJavaとかみたいに並列処理の起動コストが高かった時代の名残だと、僕はdispatcher\u0026amp;workerのことを考えてます。","ts":"1636509706.391100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g2dN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5274b7ab-6e91-44a5-a025-db98eb346851","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"(想像だけどpreforkのイメージが強い人がGoに来たときに書きがちだと思っている) (その類推でちゃんとやるなら同等のことが必要になって面倒; UWSGIでいうmax-requestsやmax-worker-lifetimeとか)","ts":"1636509646.389600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GU3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e525cb26-7d2c-4b3c-bce8-237ffaf2df7f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"これ、途端に面倒になるでしょ?","ts":"1636509584.388500","thread_ts":"1636509584.388500","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cBQ3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40d86cee-fea3-48b3-8081-832899fa5f73","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"workerみたいに走らせ続ける場合、Goではそれを正しく止める手段も用意しないといけない。まぁいまならcontext入れとけばいいんですけども。","ts":"1636509574.388100","thread_ts":"1636509574.388100","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Czkj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9391e99-aecf-4dcf-b534-0cb417922ada","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどなぁ","ts":"1636509554.387600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mGN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a692e94d-ed4f-48bf-8090-a0cd0d5a729b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; で、同時に実行するgoroutine数を制御したい→お、dispatcher\u0026amp;workerだなって間違って短絡しちゃうケースが多い \n今回まんまそれですねｗ","ts":"1636509550.387400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AtO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"512f3392-878a-4429-ba83-a67bdf933793","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"mutexとセットで出てきたときからセマフォよくわからんで避けて通ってたからなあ","ts":"1636509547.387100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z4t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6a2f1bd-93b7-4a28-8e9c-0c48e719f901","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"うーむまさに間違ってた　学び","ts":"1636509528.386400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xPoaV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6223418c-cb6d-4830-8a2a-03b3c6c731ab","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"で、同時に実行するgoroutine数を制御したい→お、dispatcher\u0026amp;workerだなって間違って短絡しちゃうケースが多い","ts":"1636509508.386100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636509518.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L4QK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"552c8f19-9510-4e22-aef5-8cbe589bff2a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどお","ts":"1636509443.385200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZM3P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15c5a085-726c-4ba1-9f4f-a6408e5b46d2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一方でGoは走らせ続けない≒goroutineでやるべき仕事を1つ終わらせたら、そのgoroutineは止まる。","ts":"1636509419.384500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ysK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aefcc88d-38dd-458f-a445-cc116a8edb1c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"workerモデルって、workerが事故って止まったときとか必要数まで自動起動したりとか、そういう要件もあるんですよね。","ts":"1636509364.383200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636509380.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j6G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b100477c-311d-410e-a0dc-90ed7db05008","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あ、そうなんですね\n\u0026gt; 微妙にGoのモデルと合わない\nこれってどういう部分が合わない感じですか？","ts":"1636509326.382200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gJ/+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8d9bc28-1c91-4edb-a5f5-a2a04ee85b80","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Dispatcher \u0026amp; Workerモデルって万能じゃないんですよ。というかWorkerを走らせ続けるって微妙にGoのモデルと合わないんです。","ts":"1636509288.381300","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636509301.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"frc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"015df317-22a8-4d57-9a26-95dbb15ff4db","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"まさにこれをやりたかった…","ts":"1636509266.380900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aVdD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"039c8f9c-e9b5-4460-b9ef-1d1a97b68420","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1636509243.380300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4g+aj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb089d1f-41fc-4e30-b6c0-31505146714e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://soarflat777.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/01/06/193231\u003e","ts":"1636509240.380000","attachments":[{"fallback":"soarflat の技術メモ: 【Go】semaphore とは？ 〜semaphore を利用してゴルーチンの同時実行数を制御する〜 - soarflat の技術メモ","id":1,"title":"【Go】semaphore とは？ 〜semaphore を利用してゴルーチンの同時実行数を制御する〜 - soarflat の技術メモ","title_link":"https://soarflat777.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/01/06/193231","text":"記事概要 semaphoreに関しての備忘録。 semaphore はどんなパッケージなのか そもそも semaphore（セマフォ）という言葉の意味に関して semaphore の利用例 semaphore とは ゴルーチンの同時実行数を制御するパッケージ。 \u003chttps://godoc.org/golang.org/x/sync/semaphore\u003e 読み方はセマフォ。 そもそも semaphore（セマフォ）という言葉の意味は？ 同時に実行されているプログラム間でのリソースの排他制御や同期を行う仕組みのこと。 現在利用可能なリソースの数のこと。 以下の記事でなんとなく仕組みは理解できる。とり…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/s/soarflat777/20200106/20200106192452.gif","blocks":null,"ts":1578306751,"service_name":"soarflat の技術メモ","service_icon":"https://soarflat777.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://soarflat777.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/01/06/193231","original_url":"https://soarflat777.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/01/06/193231"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Hv1Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"acf7e713-c9e5-47b5-b9f0-387cc0fdbe91","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"semaphore 良くわからないので、調べてみます","ts":"1636509103.379500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NB7E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5e139c5-ba88-4602-9a67-c41b08f434c8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、そういう意味なんですね","ts":"1636509094.379200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c=Lru"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c46d0c45-ee3b-46e9-9ee5-e0349fee79f7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"itchynyさんも言ってるけどchannelよりもsemaphoreで書いたほうが良いですよ。WaitGroupも要らんくなるし。","ts":"1636508234.377700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636508242.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U7H4TJEG0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_