n(); wg.Done }()`\nまさにこれだって感じですね\nありがとうございます","ts":"1636507846.374300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xhd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84065058-611a-4f5e-b561-30cb970fe4d6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどおお","ts":"1636507775.373700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kRzB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf00df58-f14d-4042-aaa8-b38d7aff9268","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"えっと設計論としての話だよね。細かい背景を考慮しなければ(まだ記事も読んでない)その依存は無くて大丈夫なはずです。\n\n`wg.Done()` をする必要があるという理由なら、WorkerというかRunnerをblockingにしておいて、Dispatcherのほうで `go func(r Runner) { r.Run(); wg.Done }()` みたいなことしても良いわけなので。","ts":"1636507672.373100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1636507747.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tbrG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"318ab16e-d535-45c6-89d5-aa5063092f64","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"答えになってないのは承知だけど、workerの初期化があまりに重いとかでなければ、セマフォで実装する方が簡単よ…","ts":"1636506604.370300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=if"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51a60c68-8779-40e4-9bff-876f5fb1e80e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"workerがdispatcherに依存せず、\ndispatcherで wg を含めて worker にメッセージを送るのが良い気がしますが、どうなんでしょうか","ts":"1636503870.369400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uSQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be5057c0-7288-4a6f-8cf9-52b7570b987f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ふわっとした疑問ですいません\nこれを読んでいて、workerってdispactherを構造体に持っていて依存しているんですが、その依存って大丈夫なんでしょうか（動くと思うけど）\n\n自分は可能な限り、依存を一方向にしたほうが良いかなって思っているんですが、\n記事の実装だとworkerの処理完了してから wg.Done() する必要があるから依存するしかないよなって思いました\n他に依存しないで書く方法ないんかなと","ts":"1636503657.368300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oqPw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80bc6dbc-ad54-44a8-b5b5-6edd0c0d24da","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://kaneshin.hateblo.jp/entry/2016/08/18/190435\u003e","ts":"1636503442.364700","attachments":[{"fallback":"at kaneshin: golang の channel を使って Dispatcher-Worker を作り goroutine 爆発させないようにする - at kaneshin","id":1,"title":"golang の channel を使って Dispatcher-Worker を作り goroutine 爆発させないようにする - at kaneshin","title_link":"https://kaneshin.hateblo.jp/entry/2016/08/18/190435","text":"golang で処理の高速化をするために goroutine/channel を使って並行処理にし、待ち時間を無駄にしないようにするのは言葉で表すのは簡単ですが、実際にパターンとして落としこむためには経験が必要だなと思うので、今回 Dispatcher-Worker として Job Queue を golang で実装する方法を紹介したいと思います。 この記事は mattn さんの Big Sky :: golang の channel を使ったテクニックあれこれ の次のステップとして読むことをオススメします。 \u003chttp://mattn.kaoriya.net|mattn.kaoriya.net\u003e golang で作成したアプリケーションで多く…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/l/laplus-knsn/20160818/20160818181940.png","blocks":null,"ts":1471514675,"service_name":"at kaneshin","service_icon":"https://kaneshin.hateblo.jp/icon/touch","from_url":"https://kaneshin.hateblo.jp/entry/2016/08/18/190435","original_url":"https://kaneshin.hateblo.jp/entry/2016/08/18/190435"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w6g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b230916-dbba-421b-880c-cb642019d62c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Undefined behavior っぽいので backlog 行きか","ts":"1636478174.364500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sx=/A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6b946ca-34b7-4493-9207-8186f00d5374","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどおお","ts":"1636512881.411900","thread_ts":"1636511177.406600","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bTpM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7325f6bb-76ae-49f1-9952-1ac028b5403b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"既存ライブラリ使うにしても、こういう当たり前のことがちゃんとできているか検証したほうが、あとあとのためには良いのです。","ts":"1636509615.389000","thread_ts":"1636509584.388500","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BnuU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e52a961f-e8e5-41af-829e-49688ad958f5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"止める場合には実行中のリクエストは完遂できるのか、とかそういうのも要検討。","ts":"1636509646.389700","thread_ts":"1636509574.388100","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P5I4g"}]}]
